59
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:21,270
From a language agnostic perspective, your server side code, your client side code that's actually serving up that API that's consuming that API could really be in like any language that you want.

60
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:28,870
So a lot of teams are building their server side implementations in Java or Python, Node, TypeScript. It doesn't really matter as long as you're building it to the spec.

