00:38:17,349 --> 00:38:22,470
I'm not going to skimp on it because you know the more and more that we move towards agents writing code and

425
00:38:22,470 --> 00:38:33,030
you know you're using like spec driven development contract driven development there's just less oversight into what's going on you really need well ststructured design and specs and testing as that

426
00:38:33,030 --> 00:38:37,670
code's like pretty quickly flowing through to production so not not something I'm going to risk with a sloppy spec.

